===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|lv|la|Austria|notext=1}}, a latinized version of {{etyl|gem|lv}} {{m|goh|ostar||eastern}} (< {{cog|gem-pro|*austraz||eastern}}; [[cf]]. also {{cog|lv|austrumi||east}}), in reference to this land being the {{m|lv|Marchia austriaca||eastern borderland}}. The word was adapted to Latvian spelling ({{suffix|lv||ija}}).

